    <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Thu, 02 Oct 2025 12:05:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Issue Resolved</h3>\n               <p>The issue on API console credit display and payment has been resolved.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Thu, 02 Oct 2025 10:45:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>API Credits Are Not Actively Reflected on Teams</h3>\n               <p>Users are having issue seeing/using newly-added API credits. Our team is actively working on resolving the issue.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 23:40:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[API (us-east-1.api.x.ai)] API Inference Incident</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/api-us-east-1/INCcb17e2</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INCcb17e2</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n           <h3>Status: RESOLVED</h3>\n           <p>Severity: available</p>\n           <p>Resolved: Fri, 19 Sep 2025 19:42:00 GMT</p>\n           <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Fri, 19 Sep 2025 19:42:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Solved</h3>\n               <p>We have addressed the issue and status of the inference api is healthy again.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Fri, 19 Sep 2025 19:24:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Reasoning models incident</h3>\n               <p>We have identified an issue with our inference clusters affecting reasoning models.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 19 Sep 2025 19:24:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[Grok (iOS)] Grok I