    <p>Grok is not responding to user requests. We are actively investigating the situation.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Thu, 14 Aug 2025 16:17:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>We have identified the issue and are working on a fix</h3>\n               <p>We have identified an issue with a service provider. Our team is working on fixing the issue.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 Aug 2025 15:10:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[Grok (Web)] Responses Using Grok 3 Might be Slower Than Usual</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/grok-com/INC7977039a</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INC7977039a</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n           <h3>Status: RESOLVED</h3>\n           <p>Severity: available</p>\n           <p>Resolved: Thu, 17 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</p>\n           <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Tue, 15 Jul 2025 16:16:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Responses Using Grok 3 Might be Slower Than Usual</h3>\n               <p>Responses that uses Grok 3 might be slower than usual. You might want to use Grok 4 instead. Our team is working on a fix.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Thu, 17 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Issue Resolved</h3>\n               <p>We have improved resource allocation.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Jul 2025 16:16:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[API (us-east-1.api.x.ai)] Grok 4 capacity issues</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/api-us-east-1/INC530d7e98</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INC530d7e98</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n           <h3>Status: RESOLVED</h3>\n           <p>Severity: available</p>\n           <p>Resolved: Fri, 11 Jul 2025 10:28:00 GMT</p>\n           <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Fri, 11 Jul 2025 10:28:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>More capacity added</h3>\n               <p>We added more capacity to resolve the current performance issues and will add an additional batch of GPUs later today to increase headroom.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Fri, 11 Jul 2025 09:10:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Adding more capacity</h3>\n               <p>We&apos;re seeing above-zero error rates on grok-4-0709 due to capacity limitations. We&apos;re adding more capacity now.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Jul 2025 09:10:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[API Console] Scheduled maintenance for the billing system</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/api-console/INC20aa890c</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INC20aa890c</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n           <h3>Status: RESOLVED</h3>\n           <p>Severity: available</p>\n           <p>Resolved: Wed, 09 Jul 2025 10:52:00 GMT</p>\n           <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 10:52:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Maintenance is complete</h3>\n               <p>The billing system is fully operational again.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 10:12:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Maintenance has started</h3>\n               <p>We have started the maintenance process. We will send an update once maintenance is complete.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 10:00:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Billing system will be unavailable</h3>\n               <p>We will perform scheduled maintenance on the billing system powering the API from 10 am UTC to 11 am UTC on July 9, 2025. During this period, you will be unable to purchase credits, view invoices, or modify spending limits.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[API (us-east-1.api.x.ai)] API</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/api-us-east-1/INC5e4b8f66</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INC5e4b8f66</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n           <h3>Status: RESOLVED</h3>\n           <p>Severity: available</p>\n           <p>Resolved: Tue, 10 Jun 2025 06:20:00 GMT</p>\n           <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 06:20:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>API Access Restored</h3>\n               <p>The API access to all models is restored.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 05:08:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>API Access to Models is Unavailable</h3>\n               <p>All models are currently unavailable on API. We are investigating the issue.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 05:08:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[API (us-east-1.api.x.ai)] Grok-3 structured output and function calling unavailable</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/api-us-east-1/INC2592e4a7</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INC2592e4a7</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n