       \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 09:40:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[Grok (Android)] Partial Outage of Grok Android App</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/android-app/INC17f20ae9</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INC17f20ae9</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n           <h3>Status: RESOLVED</h3>\n           <p>Severity: available</p>\n           <p>Resolved: Mon, 10 Mar 2025 20:30:00 GMT</p>\n           <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 09:40:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Partial Outage of Grok Android App</h3>\n               <p>We are currently experiencing elevated latencies and error rates in the Grok Android app. Users may notice Grok responding more slowly than usual or failing to respond entirely. Our team has identified the issue and is actively working on a resolution.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 20:30:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Issue Resolved</h3>\n               <p>All services are now operating normally, and users should no longer experience delays or errors.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 09:40:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[Grok (Web)] Partial Outage of grok.com</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/grok-com/INC6d5dfde</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INC6d5dfde</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n           <h3>Status: RESOLVED</h3>\n           <p>Severity: available</p>\n           <p>Resolved: Mon, 10 Mar 2025 20:30:00 GMT</p>\n           <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 09:40:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Partial Outage of grok.com</h3>\n               <p>We are currently experiencing elevated latencies and error rates on grok.com. Users may notice Grok responding more slowly than usual or failing to respond entirely. Our team has identified the issue and is actively working on a resolution.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 20:30:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Issue Resolved</h3>\n               <p>All services are now operating normally, and users should no longer experience delays or errors.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 09:40:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[API Console] Unable to Retrieve Billing Information</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/api-console/INC305008b0</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INC305008b0</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n           <h3>Status: RESOLVED</h3>\n           <p>Severity: available</p>\n           <p>Resolved: Thu, 27 Feb 2025 17:29:00 GMT</p>\n           <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Thu, 27 Feb 2025 17:29:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Restored Billing Information on API Console</h3>\n               <p>Billing information is available again on API Console.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Thu, 27 Feb 2025 17:25:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Billing Information Unavailable on API Console</h3>\n               <p>Billing information is temporarily unavailable on xAI API Console. Our team is investigating the situation and working on a fix.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 27 Feb 2025 17:25:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[Single Sign-On] Email Sending: Partial Outage</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/single-sign-on/INC7a12e6d3</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INC7a12e6d3</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n           <h3>Status: RESOLVED</h3>\n           <p>Severity: available</p>\n           <p>Resolved: Fri, 28 Feb 2025 13:07:00 GMT</p>\n           <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Thu, 27 Feb 2025 12:00:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Some Email not Being Sent</h3>\n               <p> Our platform does not correctly send some emails. This includes email verification, password reset, and download of user data. We are currently working on a fix.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Fri, 28 Feb 2025 13:07:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Email Sending Restored</h3>\n               <p>We have deployed a fix to address the email sending error.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 27 Feb 2025 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[API (us-east-1.api.x.ai)] Structured Output Unavailable on grok-2-1212</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/api-us-east-1/INC37e86c9b</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INC37e86c9b</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n           <h3>Status: RESOLVED</h3>\n           <p>Severity: available</p>\n           <p>Resolved: Tue, 21 Jan 2025 18:30:00 GMT</p>\n           <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Tue, 21 Jan 2025 18:30:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Systems Fully Restored</h3>\n               <p>All systems have been restored. Our team has identified the cause and fixed the issue.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Fri, 17 Jan 2025 22:09:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Structured Output Unavailable on grok-2-1212</h3>\n               <p>Structured output is temporarily unavailable on grok-2-1212. Our team is investigating the situation and working on a fix.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 17 Jan 2025 21:30:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n\n    <item>\n      <title>[API (us-east-1.api.x.ai)] Time Out on grok-2-1212</title>\n      <link>https://status.x.ai/api-us-east-1/INC1bc684df</link>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">INC1bc684df</guid>\n      <description><![CDATA[\n           <h3>Status: RESOLVED</h3>\n           <p>Severity: available</p>\n           <p>Resolved: Wed, 15 Jan 2025 23:40:00 GMT</p>\n           <hr />\n           <h4>Updates:</h4>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 20:30:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Redirection to grok-beta</h3>\n               <p>The usage of grok-2-1212 is redirected to grok-beta during the incident. A fix is currently being deployed.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n             <div>\n               <p><strong>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 23:40:00 GMT</strong></p>\n               <h3>Redirection to grok-beta</h3>\n               <p>All systems have been restored.</p>\n             </div>\n           \n      ]]></description>\n      <pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 20:30:00 GMT</pubDate>\n      <category>available</category>\n      <category>resolved</category>\n    </item>\n  </channel>\n</rss>"
